toptencompaniesLoading":true,"isFilter":true,"waitingPeriod":[],"citydata":[],"cityloading":true,"resetvehiclesearch":false,"comparevehicles":[],"latestElectricScooter":[],"latestElectricBike":[],"latestElectricCar":[],"commercialVehicles":[],"faqList":[],"latestReviews":[],"blogdata":[],"statedata":[],"stateloading":true,"sponserproducts":[],"sponserproductsloading":true,"backgroundBannerImages":[],"popularimages":[],"popularImagesLoading":true,"filterData":{"page":1,"limit":9},"filterDataLoading":true},"vehicle":{"vehicleDetails":{"_id":"6a183d32ac1cbb688337a36d","vehicleLabels":[{"labelName":"New","color":"#008000","description":""}],"title":"Tiago EV Pure + 24 kWh","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe \u003cstrong\u003eTata Tiago EV Pure+ 24 kWh\u003c/strong\u003e stands out as a highly practical and feature-rich long-range electric hatchback, perfectly tailored for Indian buyers seeking zero-emission mobility. Positioned to offer an elevated driving experience, this variant takes the practicality of a compact city car and pairs it with enhanced battery capacity, making it an ideal choice for both daily urban commutes and extended weekend drives. Its modern design, combined with a silent and smooth automatic drive, ensures a comfortable journey while significantly reducing running costs. For buyers wanting to step into the electric vehicle ecosystem with confidence, the Pure+ 24 kWh trim delivers exceptional value, modern aesthetics, and everyday reliability.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003ePowering this variant is a larger, liquid-cooled 24 kWh battery pack that produces 74 BHP and a peak torque of 114 Nm. This robust Ziptron technology enables a certified MIDC range of up to 285 km on a single charge, effectively eliminating range anxiety for inter-city travel. Fast charging adds to the convenience, with the battery capable of charging from 10% to 80% in just 58 minutes using a DC fast charger. For customers opting for the Battery-as-a-Service (BaaS) framework to manage their purchase, it is important to note that both the vehicle and the battery are entirely owned by the customer from the very first day. The BaaS model is simply an innovative financial structure designed to lower upfront acquisition costs, providing absolute ownership and peace of mind without any hidden leasing conditions.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eBeyond its impressive performance, the Tata Tiago EV Pure+ 24 kWh is packed with premium technology and stringent safety features to maximize comfort and security. The cabin is highlighted by a sleek 8-inch touchscreen infotainment system featuring wireless Apple CarPlay and Android Auto, seamless steering-mounted audio controls, and a vibrant 4-speaker sound system. Daily convenience is further enhanced by fully automatic climate control, electrically adjustable ORVMs, and a reverse parking camera for effortless maneuvering in tight spaces. Safety is uncompromising, with the variant offering 6 airbags as standard, ABS with EBD, and a Tyre Pressure Monitoring System (TPMS), making it a comprehensively equipped and secure electric hatchback for the modern family.\u003c/p\u003e","image":["https://cdn.evindia.online/uploads/vehicle_image/2026-05-28-13-05-46-337-Photoroom.png","https://cdn.evindia.online/uploads/vehicle_image/2026-05-28-13-05-46-1200800mainimage-Photoroom.png","https://cdn.evindia.online/uploads/vehicle_image/2026-05-28-13-05-46-335-Photoroom.png","https://cdn.evindia.online/uploads/vehicle_image/2026-05-28-13-05-46-336-Photoroom.png","https://cdn.evindia.online/uploads/vehicle_image/2026-05-28-13-05-46-338-Photoroom.png","https://cdn.evindia.online/uploads/vehicle_image/2026-05-28-13-05-46-339-Photoroom.png"],"location":[{"state":"61e66a792e0f24388ffccac6","cities":[{"city":"649e833b0ae8203a21529fc9"}]},{"state":"61e66a7c2e0f24388ffcce29","cities":[{"city":"649e83ac0ae8203a2152c045"},{"city":"649e83b20ae8203a2152c207"}]},{"state":"61e66a7a2e0f24388ffccc3d","cities":[{"city":"649e83570ae8203a2152a7c9"},{"c